    "project": "research/general_translation_audit_20261115/lean",
    "theorem": "GeneralTranslationAudit.actual_general_translation_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_general_translation_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (hΔ : W.Δ≠0), (∀ (Q : W.Point) (c : K), generalTranslationEquiv W hΔ Q (constantHom W c)=constantHom W c) ∧ (∀ Q R : W.Point, (generalTranslation W hΔ Q).comp (generalTranslation W hΔ R)= generalTranslation W hΔ (Q+R)) ∧ generalTranslation W hΔ 0=RingHom.id W.FunctionField ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), (generalTranslationEquiv W hΔ Q).symm f=generalTranslation W hΔ (-Q) f) ∧ Function.Injective (generalTranslation W hΔ) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), localFunctionValuation W P (generalTranslation W hΔ Q f)=localFunctionValuation W (P+Q) f) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), pointOrder W (generalTranslation W hΔ Q f) P=pointOrder W f (P+Q)) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W (P+Q)), (generalRegularEquiv W hΔ P Q r : W.FunctionField)=generalTranslation W hΔ Q r) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W P), ((generalRegularEquiv W hΔ P Q).symm r : W.FunctionField)=generalTranslation W hΔ (-Q) r) ∧ (∀ (P Q : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W (P+Q)), regularEvaluation W P (generalRegularTranslation W hΔ P Q r)=regularEvaluation W (P+Q) r) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField) (hf : f≠0), functionDivisor W (generalTranslation W hΔ Q f) (general_translation_nonzero W hΔ Q hf)= divisorTranslation W (-Q) (functionDivisor W f hf)) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ), Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W (generalTranslatedUnit W hΔ Q f) (generalTranslatedUnit W hΔ Q f).ne_zero).support ↔ Disjoint (divisorTranslation W Q D).support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) ∧ (∀ (Q : W.Point) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hd : Disjoint (divisorTranslation W Q D).support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support), evaluateDivisor W D (generalTranslatedUnit W hΔ Q f) ((general_translation_disjoint_support W hΔ Q D f).mpr hd)= evaluateDivisor W (divisorTranslation W Q D) f hd)) ∧ (∀ (K L : Type) [Field K] [Field L] [Algebra K L] [DecidableEq K] [DecidableEq L] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (hΔ : W.Δ≠0), (∀ Q : W.Point, (extensionField L W).comp (generalTranslation W hΔ Q)= (generalTranslation (extensionCurve L W) (extension_delta L W hΔ) (extensionPoint L W Q)).comp (extensionField L W)) ∧ (∀ (P : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), localFunctionValuation (extensionCurve L W) (extensionPoint L W P) (extensionField L W f)= localFunctionValuation W P f) ∧ (∀ (P : W.Point) (f : W.FunctionField), pointOrder (extensionCurve L W) (extensionField L W f) (extensionPoint L W P)=pointOrder W f P) ∧ (∀ P : W.Point, Function.Injective (extensionRegular L W P)) ∧ (∀ (P : W.Point) (r : RegularRing W P), regularEvaluation (extensionCurve L W) (extensionPoint L W P) (extensionRegular L W P r)= algebraMap K L (regularEvaluation W P r))) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (hΔ : W.Δ≠0) (Q : W.Point), generalTranslation W hΔ Q=fieldTranslation W hΔ Q) ∧ CharP GeneralF2 2 ∧ binaryCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ binaryPoint≠0 ∧ generalTranslation binaryCurve binary_delta binaryPoint≠RingHom.id binaryCurve.FunctionField ∧ CharP GeneralF3 3 ∧ ternaryCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ ternaryPoint≠0 ∧ generalTranslation ternaryCurve ternary_delta ternaryPoint≠RingHom.id ternaryCurve.FunctionField ∧ CharP GeneralF5 5 ∧ (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5).Δ≠0 ∧ (¬ ∃ a : (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5).CoordinateRing, generalTranslation (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5) finite_example_delta (translationExampleQ GeneralF5) (xFunction (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5))= algebraMap (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5).CoordinateRing (translationExampleCurve GeneralF5).FunctionField a) ∧ (∀ Q : rationalCurve.Point, divisorDegree rationalCurve (functionDivisor rationalCurve (generalTranslation rationalCurve rational_delta Q numeratorFunction) (general_translation_nonzero rationalCurve rational_delta Q numerator_function_nonzero))=(-4 : ℤ))",
    "decl_sha256": "1b948fe2fb1c6a1af59ef94db55340d8d15f3080d15f149ee4d80771b2161168",
    "scope": "Actual elliptic translation over every coefficient field, every nonsingular general Weierstrass model and every characteristic including 2/3. Actual generic translated-coordinate difference has normalized value exp(-1) or exp(-2), with the zero-y-derivative branch using actual nonsingularity. Actual coefficient valuation is trivial; the credited official Valuation.transcendental_of_ne_one proves actual translated abscissa transcendence without algebraic closure. Actual norm-product injectivity/fraction-field lift/coefficient-x-y action/actual generic Point.map/generation derive coefficient-fixing FF RingEquiv/composition/zero/explicit negative-point inverse/faithfulness and agreement with frozen AC construction. Actual arbitrary coefficient-field extension square derived from actual generic coordinates/fractions. Actual K-rational point localization map commutes with full-field and residue maps; actual derivative branches preserve chosen uniformizer, actual unit and uniformizer factorization derive normalized finite-point valuation basechange. Existing actual infinity norm-degree basechange credited. Actual AC comparison in proof plus derived extension bridges yields every-field all-point local valuation/order/regular RingEquiv/explicit inverse/residue. Actual coefficient-extension regular-ring injection and image-point residue diagram derived. Actual K-rational principal-divisor pullback Q equals point pushforward negative Q; actual support-disjointness iff/guarded divisor evaluation derived. No general geometric degree-zero or divisor/Picard/Galois descent assertion over nonclosed fields. Actual nonsingular F2 y²+y=x³ and credited actual F3 curve have actual nonzero points/nonidentity FF translations. Credited source formula1/x,-y/x² now arbitrary valid coefficient field; direct actual F5 non-affine-ring counter. Credited actual F3 numeratorFunction rational-point divisor degree minus four persists under every actual translation. Known source methods and controls credited/no new population/qualified-source refutation/novelty. Twelve new concrete modules/105 frozen modules/zero copies/117 old formal files/all134 old pins checked before-after11 states and gate. Four failed01/03/06/07/seven successes retained; exact source/root coverage asserted every state from01; no new root omission or timeout, final11/source warnings0. Fresh Galbraith correctedch7 PDF6-9 printed128-131 and ch9PDF3-4 printed167-168 fulltext and every individual page visual, actual fraction/uniformizer/translation statements/proofs as recorded; Lemma7.3.6 exercise proof not claimed/no whole chapter or Scheme proof read. Official trivial-valuation transcendence proof, actual Point.map/generation, norm and local DVR methods read/reused; relative algebraic closure reviewed alternative not selected. Four correct KB calls plus fifth valuation query all127, Conductor127 before code; bounded fallback/no absence claim. Copyright local only. Separate Scheme/line-bundle comparison, general geometric divisor/Picard/Galois descent, reciprocity, isogeny/Lang/Jacobian, canonical Weil/Tate/MOV/FR and full14 remain open. Same host/prover/procedural written-header check, not independent parser/compiler/physical-host assurance; signedunverified. Default limits/standard foundations/no holes/custom axioms/native proof evaluation/raised limits/new global flags/waivers/frozen edits/cryptoPython/native crypto experiment/spend/upload.",
